  "notes": {
    "raw": "Phase change: 876 K, sublimation point of As(α) to As₄(g); ΔH° = 33.235 kcal/mol of As₄(g). \nHeat capacity (cal/mol·K) and enthalpy (kcal/mol) equations: \n298.15-3000 K: $Cp^{0} = 10.044 - 0.304 \\times 10^{-3} T - 1.448 \\times 10^{5} T^{-2}$ $H^{0} - H_{298}^{0} = 10.044 \\times 10^{-3} T - 0.152 \\times 10^{-6} T^{2} + 1.448 \\times 10^{2} T^{-1} - 3.467$ \nReaction equations (kcal/mol): \n298.15-876 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 29.540 + 0.181 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.883 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 98.250 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ $\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 29.540 - 0.181 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.883 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 49.125 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 20.795 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ 876-1600 K: $\\Delta \\mathrm{Hr}^{\\circ} = 20.212 + 0.880 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} - 0.305 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 66.750 \\mathrm{T}^{-1}$ $\\Delta \\mathrm{Gr}^{\\circ} = 20.212 - 0.880 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T} \\ln \\mathrm{T} + 0.305 \\times 10^{-6} \\mathrm{T}^{2} + 33.375 \\mathrm{T}^{-1} - 4.891 \\times 10^{-3} \\mathrm{T}$ \nSource: Data from Mah (73). ",
    "lines_raw": [
      "Phase change: 876 K, sublimation point of As(α) to As₄(g); ΔH° = 33.235 kcal/mol of As₄(g).",
